This Ques has various approaches:
1. Recursion + Memoization (Using 2 pointers)
2. Bottom Up (Normal)
3. Bottom Up (Using BluePrint)
4. Using LPS (longest Palindrmic Subsequence => Min Insertion = Total Length - LPS) code not available.
5. Bottom Up (Space Optimization)

1:
class Solution {
    public int minInsertions(String s) {
        int n = s.length();
        int[] dp = new int[n];

        for (int i = n - 2; i >= 0; i--) {
            int prev = 0; // holds dp[i+1][j-1]
            for (int j = i + 1; j < n; j++) {
                int temp = dp[j]; // save before overwrite (becomes next prev)
                if (s.charAt(i) == s.charAt(j)) {
                    dp[j] = prev;
                } else {
                    dp[j] = 1 + Math.min(dp[j], dp[j - 1]);
                }
                prev = temp;
            }
        }

        return dp[n - 1];
    }
}

T.C. -> O(n^2)
S.C. -> O(n^2) (Memoization Array) , Stack Memory (Recursion): O(n)

